produce V_emp = (sub-window W_1 vector) pointwise — exactly E1.5 (Riemann's explicit formula). Structural-matching headline survives, but its mathematical content reduces to E1.5 already in project. S108 grade stays B. Verify chain saturated after 7 sessions; parser fix applied to S108 self-grade line so run.sh rotates back to production. See `experiments/analytic/stein_wasserstein_pi/verify_S115_subwindow_rand_phases_results.md`, `archive/sessions/session115_verify_c5_stein.md`. | 108, 109, 110, 111, 112, 113, 114, 115 |
